294/ss_76086c39aec18855faee2204248ecc6b0e2bb294.600x338.jpg?t=1772654594"},{"id":8,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069820/24eb4c997f65d52f638d5c2e83d7ae51c55cdf6a/ss_24eb4c997f65d52f638d5c2e83d7ae51c55cdf6a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772654594","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069820/24eb4c997f65d52f638d5c2e83d7ae51c55cdf6a/ss_24eb4c997f65d52f638d5c2e83d7ae51c55cdf6a.600x338.jpg?t=1772654594"},{"id":9,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069820/9585a08b35c238861f4798f6cd4e84504ad893a6/ss_9585a08b35c238861f4798f6cd4e84504ad893a6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772654594","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069820/9585a08b35c238861f4798f6cd4e84504ad893a6/ss_9585a08b35c238861f4798f6cd4e84504ad893a6.600x338.jpg?t=1772654594"}],"short_description":"You've been hired as a chief editor to make this newspaper grow, but your writers are awful. Correct their drafts, set the tone of the news to fit your audience, make readership grow; and form a relationship with the shady politicians that will push you to give them good press in an electoral year","steam_appid":3069820,"support_info":{"email":"augusto.salgado@elephteria.ar","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://elephteria.ar"}